message: "If you use this register, please cite it as below."
title: "FUELDIV: Fuel Divergence Atlas - Specification Divergence Register"
abstract: >-
  A property-by-property register of where the diesel certification test fuel
  envelope (40 CFR 1065.703), the federal in-market fuel requirement (40 CFR
  1090), and commercial fuel standards fail to overlap, joined to the certified
  compression-ignition engine population from CIDEX.
